---
title: AllocationPlanVersion State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AwaitingApproval : new priced plan version created
    AwaitingApproval --> Approved : Admin approves this version
    AwaitingApproval --> RecalculationRequested : Admin asks to re-plan
    AwaitingApproval --> Superseded : a newer plan version replaces this one
    Approved --> Superseded : replaced by a later approved version
    RecalculationRequested --> [*]
    Superseded --> [*]
